# Used by packages/database (drizzle-kit + @repo/database client).
#
# The database is Cloudflare D1 (see packages/database/wrangler.jsonc — binding "DB",
# database "ssa-db"). There is no live connection string:
#   - drizzle-kit generate/validate uses a local SQLite file (file:./local.db) only.
#   - At runtime the D1 binding is injected by the Cloudflare Workers runtime.
# Apply migrations with `pnpm db:local` (local D1) or `pnpm db:deploy` (remote D1).
